{"posts":[{"id":"quasimodo_p28_676","t":"Is this correct?","a":"josh1125","d":"","n":"#676","p":28,"im":["e0cdd95cf92026f664e5b22b1cd0896f12490efc"],"fa":"آیا این درست است؟","m":676},{"id":"quasimodo_p28_677","t":"sure is Josh","a":"DrSwing","d":"","n":"#677","p":28,"im":[],"m":677},{"id":"quasimodo_p28_678","t":"a posible QM level on EU H4","a":"shumik","d":"","n":"#678","p":28,"im":["e345a2e6d1361abd05d14458fba1001ebacafcbc"],"m":678},{"id":"quasimodo_p28_679","t":"Hello\n\nI was practicing compression but i realized there was an engulf pattern as price compressed.\n\nIs this a valid quasimodo?\n\nBtw if valid these are some crazy 10:1 possible reward trades, i find this really amazing i must go back to more homework\n\nPlease give me some feedback,\n\nThank you","a":"baelar","d":"","n":"#679","p":28,"im":["7fd84b815af00a6411b32187ba564d6415f69e05"],"m":679},{"id":"quasimodo_p28_680","t":"Yes Baelar, that is a valid QM","a":"DrSwing","d":"","n":"#680","p":28,"im":[],"m":680},{"id":"quasimodo_p28_681","t":"Try","a":"Experiorz","d":"","n":"#681","p":28,"im":["35592e0b170c3af8da36fa3b5532e189690a4044","4fd908a019050b86a2a92079e73da80d4326d67b","0fcdec048a7d79ab24f6fc820bb1298706efb00e","ed641f8e78578aafba5172bdfce7fdd4021d8e2a","7e1e7abe9c3158113d784e110bcca8881abea552"],"m":681},{"id":"quasimodo_p28_682","t":"The market's closed, but found this, would have taken this short if I was there to monitor it. I'm a swing trader partly because I have a full time job. Mostly I like to trade in the bigger time frames, more suitable for me and I don't have to be there all the time to monitor the charts.\n\nIt could work, might not work, but the pattern is there. The market is random, but market shows what we define high probability trades. And here's a QM on the 5m level inside a HTF 60m DBD Supply ZoneThe location looks really good. 5m chart showing weakness with its swing lower low and lower high\n\nWhat do you guys think?","a":"projectsagana","d":"","n":"#682","p":28,"im":[],"m":682},{"id":"quasimodo_p28_683","t":"Hey PS, looks like it could have shown promise but came at one of the worst time! NU had quite a roller coaster of a week with the big drop and then rallying to cover half of it. With that much movement there may be a gap after the weekend. If so, that would seem to invalidate the QM, and if not, it seems like trading at the 2nd worst time - low liquidity at the week's open.\n\nDo you trade gaps?","a":"polymorph","d":"","n":"#683","p":28,"im":[],"m":683},{"id":"quasimodo_p28_684","t":"Other than the hump on his back, I've never really seen the similarity between a trading QM and the film version. I think someone with FAR more creativity than me came up with that one!:) But I do see how a colon with a closed parentheses is a sideways smiley face so at least I have that going for me. Anyway, here are some QM's.","a":"polymorph","d":"","n":"#684","p":28,"im":["9f2b3f18ba9c28a1cc523df864059dd58c92ebca","40978a66db20d87ae2c577a5441e2145143f51f2","394b94da2e333ccd8424c26bb5a7c58f9a05a228","b710bb750e8ad839cd011ff99c9c5a1e98bcb7fb","9a817ba9d4d3276250ffdb20312740cf43a1cdc6","cd2493c489fef3e89f3e1d95069a6640f5d40693","06d29c2f89446e814e2a03ae969808f2988101cb","f25e6bd1d5337f980e9a249ba5591f4d6e0b306b","5329dfd6901fe0a26d5c84fc16381f320ff290df"],"m":684},{"id":"quasimodo_p28_685","t":"Mas Quasimodos.","a":"polymorph","d":"","n":"#685","p":28,"im":["8e92339a67d08aef40338ba8185f057968a33a06","500552dff95c8aefe22287008fe060199f9d9fb2","2ff08df7bd9fd6b8bec38b76163e8df755db2723","a466773bd07883836493fa9403ee8d1fc81b8a8f","b1fce1bc9ff8283b9522f3d09cf35b5a501a3516"],"m":685},{"id":"quasimodo_p28_686","t":"Poly,\n\nI wanted to take a shot at analyzing one of your charts to see why the QM failed. Well in the chart posted below, there is a FL that was never engulfed showing that there was a possibility of a failed QM. Had the LL taken out that FL, then demand would have been cleared, and price would have been able to fall.","a":"josh1125","d":"","n":"#686","p":28,"im":["6a300ab0d5dfcbbc740dc99eb0fb2c793eb88e0b"],"m":686},{"id":"quasimodo_p28_687","t":"Mas Quasimodos dos.","a":"polymorph","d":"","n":"#687","p":28,"im":["11703c88717c595fa4f508a47440ad56ec8c9dce","da4af55b9cb5e1d89659506695f43661cd9d646f","a845d9447ef66e13c7c4eff938d4b7ca8783222e"],"m":687},{"id":"quasimodo_p28_688","t":"homework on QMs","a":"projectsagana","d":"","n":"#688","p":28,"im":[],"m":688},{"id":"quasimodo_p28_689","t":"Been reading up on Quasimodo. Looks like an extremely serious approach to solid trades. Here's my first exercise (meant to post many more but with both kids at home and severe competition for all three machines at home, I had to surrender!). Would appreciate some feedback on my first attempt.\n\nFound another QM within the same setup.","a":"Miserly_One","d":"","n":"#689","p":28,"im":["e7cf6b6ba4058728d6238041cbc911dc40b3abd5","9a265d3426b650c48185df57d45433297c1f3b3d"],"m":689},{"id":"quasimodo_p28_690","t":"Hi Miserly_One\n\nThought I would comment on your chart. The first QM the one marked with green I think is a valid QM. The QM within the QM to me isn't great I see more of a Can Can as marked on the chart.\n\nBut here's a question for you, can you identify the other QM in the chart? Have a look and see if yo can see it.","a":"in2forex","d":"","n":"#690","p":28,"im":["7ab7a49de4f5ab753cfb93598b4097d05037f383"],"m":690},{"id":"quasimodo_p28_691","t":"Thanks In2forex! Greatly appreciate your input. As regards the nested QM, I see what you mean by it being more like a Can Can rather than a QM. Point gratefully taken!\n\nYou hinted to the presence of another QM - I think I see a bullish QM. Initially I was a little concerned about the huge number of bars between the HH and the revisit to the demand level. But I sense it does not really matter as long as the basic form of the pattern can be seen. Do let me know if my identification of the bullish QM is correct.","a":"Miserly_One","d":"","n":"#691","p":28,"im":["e27189e453f8b6dc498b5c174865e343299e87a5"],"m":691},{"id":"quasimodo_p28_692","t":"For whatever reason, I tend to see bearish patterns far more easily than bullish ones!\n\nHowever with QM, it's starting to look like I might overcome my bias! Here's a bullish\n\none - just hoping it is right.","a":"Miserly_One","d":"","n":"#692","p":28,"im":["d0c49a4568f2e1547a5b874872b71d857abcef36"],"m":692},{"id":"quasimodo_p28_693","t":"Hi Miserly_One\n\nYou picked it perfectly. Notice the DD almost if not 0 pips.\n\nThe last one is also great. notice this one is going with the trend. Great stuff.","a":"in2forex","d":"","n":"#693","p":28,"im":[],"m":693},{"id":"quasimodo_p28_694","t":"Thank you In2forex! That's a confidence booster for me!\n\nFound one more bullish QM - a little leery about this one though, mainly because of the lack of low drawdown. Unless of course, I use the low at the start of the smaller green demand zone shown on chart. Your insight please.\n\nKind regards, MO\n\nin2forex wrote: Hi Miserly_One\n\nYou picked it perfectly. Notice the DD almost if not 0 pips.\n\nThe last one is also great. notice this one is going with the trend. Great stuff.","a":"Miserly_One","d":"","n":"#694","p":28,"im":["1a47f4a7c8d1f1b085df12374334d2f38d26121c"],"m":694},{"id":"quasimodo_p28_695","t":"Last one for the day! Bullish QM.","a":"Miserly_One","d":"","n":"#695","p":28,"im":["39ab73b4b74cee9d693e1759c907a6fef9e0159e"],"m":695},{"id":"quasimodo_p28_696","t":"In my eyes, this is a valid bearish QM. But I'd like some wiser minds to point out any errors I may have made.","a":"Miserly_One","d":"","n":"#696","p":28,"im":["54b4ed8c0dc755dc87d538bd5841b93cbf488dc2"],"m":696},{"id":"quasimodo_p28_697","t":"Hi MO\n\nYip to me that's a valid QM. Now once again can you see any more on your chart?","a":"in2forex","d":"","n":"#697","p":28,"im":[],"m":697},{"id":"quasimodo_p28_698","t":"Thanks for responding, In2forex! I've marked what I think is another QM (there might be even more). This is getting very interesting - gotta love these QMs.\n\nin2forex wrote: Hi MO\n\nYip to me that's a valid QM. Now once again can you see any more on your chart?","a":"Miserly_One","d":"","n":"#698","p":28,"im":["b66bb32739bab1e5353ba252988038f154adf8be"],"m":698},{"id":"quasimodo_p28_699","t":"Please judge","a":"gigiocean","d":"","n":"#699","p":28,"im":["98f4e3c4576dd71a21df5ce3381fc037be963829","7cbbfc31e3b0a468cabfa8c6e5cde5878395ff5d"],"m":699},{"id":"quasimodo_p28_700","t":"why is this a diamond?","a":"Harry","d":"","n":"#700","p":28,"im":[],"m":700}],"images":[{"k":"e0cdd95cf92026f664e5b22b1cd0896f12490efc","t":"assets/thumbs/e0cdd95cf92026f664e5b22b1cd0896f12490efc.webp","f":"assets/images/e0cdd95cf92026f664e5b22b1cd0896f12490efc.png","w":1019,"h":660,"b":25054,"o":"e0cdd95cf92026f664e5b22b1cd0896f12490efc.png","p":28,"pid":"quasimodo_p28_676"},{"k":"e345a2e6d1361abd05d14458fba1001ebacafcbc","t":"assets/thumbs/e345a2e6d1361abd05d14458fba1001ebacafcbc.webp","f":"assets/images/e345a2e6d1361abd05d14458fba1001ebacafcbc.png","w":1328,"h":594,"b":24835,"o":"e345a2e6d1361abd05d14458fba1001ebacafcbc.png","p":28,"pid":"quasimodo_p28_678"},{"k":"7fd84b815af00a6411b32187ba564d6415f69e05","t":"assets/thumbs/7fd84b815af00a6411b32187ba564d6415f69e05.webp","f":"assets/images/7fd84b815af00a6411b32187ba564d6415f69e05.jpeg","w":1500,"h":687,"b":59064,"o":"7fd84b815af00a6411b32187ba564d6415f69e05.jpeg","p":28,"pid":"quasimodo_p28_679"},{"k":"35592e0b170c3af8da36fa3b5532e189690a4044","t":"assets/thumbs/35592e0b170c3af8da36fa3b5532e189690a4044.webp","f":"assets/images/35592e0b170c3af8da36fa3b5532e189690a4044.jpeg","w":1362,"h":488,"b":99713,"o":"35592e0b170c3af8da36fa3b5532e189690a4044.jpeg","p":28,"pid":"quasimodo_p28_681"},{"k":"4fd908a019050b86a2a92079e73da80d4326d67b","t":"assets/thumbs/4fd908a019050b86a2a92079e73da80d4326d67b.webp","f":"assets/images/4fd908a019050b86a2a92079e73da80d4326d67b.jpeg","w":1360,"h":489,"b":120419,"o":"4fd908a019050b86a2a92079e73da80d4326d67b.jpeg","p":28,"p